  "description": {
    "en": "Kirschbaum Max Power Rough uses the same powerful co-polyester platform as Max Power but adds a geometric textured profile to increase ball grip and spin transfer. It retains the explosive acceleration, direct response and control of the standard version while providing greater bite on the ball for aggressive modern baseline play. The 1.20 mm gauge maximizes spin and acceleration, the 1.25 mm version offers the best overall balance, and the 1.30 mm version emphasizes durability and stability.",

    "zh": "Kirschbaum Max Power Rough 采用与标准 Max Power 相同的高性能共聚酯材料平台，但加入几何纹理表面，以增强球线对网球的咬合和旋转传递。它保留了 Max Power 标志性的爆发加速、直接击球反馈和精准控制，同时提供更强的旋转与球感抓取能力。1.20毫米版本更强调旋转与加速；1.25毫米综合表现最均衡；1.30毫米则更偏向耐久性、稳定性和重击表现。"
  },

